# Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W, RISC-V

The same Pico 2 W hardware as pico2-w-arm, built for its Hazard3 cores. The
Pico SDK external build owns startup and linking; platform.pico.mcu supplies
GPIO, the default hardware UART, and the monotonic timer. Wireless CYW43
facilities and its CYW43-attached LED remain outside the portable board contract.
